ion ignores the squirrel, we can deduce that the squirrel dislikes the cat.\n   - Nevertheless, we must establish a direct link from the cat avoiding the lion to the cat disliking the mouse.\n   - Based on the information, we cannot directly conclude that the cat likes the mouse based on the provided statements\n. Therefore, my final option is: ']] 12%|#1        | 71/600 [05:16<05:10,  1.70it/s] 12%|#2        | 72/600 [05:16<04:10,  2.11it/s]
