**.\n11.**If something visits the tiger and the tiger is not red then it is not nice.**.\n\nFrom the information given, we can deduce the following:.\n- The tiger chases the lion (from point 1).\n- According to point 6, if something chases the lion, it is big.Since the tiger chases the lion, the tiger must be big.\n- The tiger eats the dog (from point 2), and the dog is not big (since the tiger is big and the tiger eats the dog, the dog must be smaller).The tiger is not big.. Therefore, my final option is: ']]
