ses the cat, it sees the cat.\n   - If something sees the tiger, the tiger is big.\n   - Green, big things are young.\n   - Big things are cold.\n\n2.**Key Points to Consider:**.\n   - The tiger chases the cat.\n   - The tiger is green and big.The tiger does see the cat because the tiger is chasing the cat, and the tiger is chasing the cat. Therefore, my final option is: ']]
