on then they are green.\n   - If the bald eagle is red then the bald eagle is nice.\n   - All nice people are cold.If someone ignores the dog and the dog dislikes the cat then they never see the bald eagle.\nIf someone is gentle then they dislike the dog.\n. Therefore, my final option is: ']]
