tion does apply to Dave.\n\n3.**Conclusion:**.\n   - We know that Dave is red.\n   - We also know that red people are smart.\n   - Since Dave is red, he cannot be smart.\n\nGiven the information, we can conclude that Dave is not red.Therefore, the statement "Dave is red" is false.\n\nThe correct answer is:\n. Therefore, my final option is: ']]
